From: AltVivo-Integration <integration@altvivo.invalid>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 06:58:28 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Serve as a static app behind AltVivo SSO + paid gate; retire
 the Express server

Removed (security): server/ auto-created an account for any email at /api/auth/login,
accepted any password for OAuth-only accounts, stored unsalted SHA-256 passwords and
exposed unauthenticated project/video APIs with credentialed CORS for any origin;
data/users.json contained a personal record.

- Dockerfile: Node 22 LTS build -> unprivileged nginx 1.30 on :8080; nginx.conf for the container
- src/lib/altvivo.ts + mock-auth.tsx: session from api.altvivo.bio, sign-in/out via altvivo.bio,
  tracking tokens from /v1/auth/app-token (same hook names, components unchanged)
- contact form posts to api.altvivo.bio/v1/public/contact and reports failures honestly
- <altvivo-topbar>; inline theme script moved to /theme-init.js (CSP without unsafe-inline)
