+If `VITE_TRACKING_API_URL` is set, the browser calls that service with a short-lived token from `POST https://api.altvivo.bio/v1/auth/app-token`. The service must verify it as an RS256 JWT against `https://api.altvivo.bio/.well-known/jwks.json`, with issuer `https://api.altvivo.bio` and audience `amaze`.
 
